                'p2'                  => ['O huzurdan Olympos Lodge doğdu. Yirmi bin metrekarelik bahçeye yerleştirilmiş on yedi tek katlı oda.', 'From that stillness, Olympos Lodge grew. Seventeen rooms, single-storey, set across twenty thousand square metres of garden.', 'Aus dieser Stille wuchs Olympos Lodge. Siebzehn einstöckige Zimmer, verteilt über zwanzigtausend Quadratmeter Garten.'],
